we are going to deploy an E-Commerce application like flipkart, Amazon etc

In this E-Commerce there is a lot of applications are exist

In this E-Commerce we have multiple branches for application code for combining allthose multiple branches we can say as E-Commerce application code

By using Jenins in the inside Jenkins we will use multistage pipeline option to run all the multiple branches at a time 

By writing Jenkins file like below

pipeline {
agent any
  stages {
    stage ("build") {
      steps {
        sh 'docker build -t fe-img .'
        }
      }
  }
}



